WEBVTT

00:06:28.259 --> 00:06:31.470
The only thing that he feels
is missing is the wind.

00:06:32.596 --> 00:06:37.268
Lando is one of these digital natives,
a new class of gamer,

00:06:37.309 --> 00:06:41.897
where he drives in both the physical
world and the digital world

00:06:41.939 --> 00:06:43.816
in that shared community.

00:06:44.859 --> 00:06:49.071
The difference in Formula 1
between coming first and second

00:06:49.113 --> 00:06:51.782
is a fraction of a second.

00:06:52.575 --> 00:06:56.036
When you have elite people,
those 20 people in that car,

00:06:56.078 --> 00:06:59.498
the only way they can go
and get better is by data.

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:02.042
It's the only way
they can differentiate themselves,